{"id":"c1","question":"物理伤害的基本公式是什么？","category":"concept","gold_answer":"物理伤害 = max(Atk_final × 技能倍率 − 有效防御力, 5% × Atk_final)；有效防御力 = max(DEF − 无视防御固定值, 0) × (1 − 无视防御比例)。","gold_value":null,"tolerance":1.0,"formula_ids":["physical_damage"],"citation_ids":["wiki_gg_damage_physical"],"refusal_expected":false,"clarify_expected":false,"notes":"概念题，不要求数值"}
{"id":"c2","question":"明日方舟伤害的 5% 保底是按什么计算的？","category":"concept","gold_answer":"按攻击者最终攻击力 Atk_final 的 5% 计算，不是技能倍率后伤害的 5%。","gold_value":null,"tolerance":1.0,"formula_ids":["physical_damage"],"citation_ids":["wiki_gg_damage_physical"],"refusal_expected":false,"clarify_expected":false,"notes":"高频误区"}
